CCC   FORMATS                                                           P-N00690
C                                                                       P-N00700
   10 FORMAT (A60)                                                      P-N00710
   11 FORMAT (3I3,2F10.3)                                               P-N00720
   12 FORMAT (6F10.3)                                                   P-N00730
